# What GitHub's language bar should be counting.
#
# Linguist measures bytes of source, and without help it measures the wrong
# bytes here: the comparison programs that exist so a benchmark has something
# to compare against, the fixtures a fuzzer reads, and three directories whose
# contents are written by a script in this repository rather than by a person.
# None of that is the project's source, and all of it was being reported as
# though it were.
#
# What stays counted is what somebody actually wrote: the compiler in
# crates/ and the gates and generators in scripts/. The compiler being Rust is
# a fact about the bootstrap, not something to hide behind an attribute.
#
# The language that will still not appear is Grasm. There are 1,218 .gr files
# and roughly 286,000 lines of it in this repository, and Linguist reports 0%,
# because Linguist has no entry for the extension. That needs a pull request
# to github/linguist, and their bar is adoption across many repositories --
# so it is a thing that becomes possible after users, not before them.

# Benchmarks: the same eight programs written in six other languages, so that
# `scripts/bench.sh` has a baseline. Fixtures, not implementation.
benchmarks/c/**        linguist-vendored
benchmarks/go/**       linguist-vendored
benchmarks/nim/**      linguist-vendored
benchmarks/python/**   linguist-vendored
benchmarks/rust/**     linguist-vendored
benchmarks/zig/**      linguist-vendored
benchmarks/external/** linguist-vendored
benchmarks/systems/**  linguist-vendored
benchmarks/security/** linguist-vendored

# Inputs a fuzzer or a conformance run reads. Nobody wrote these as prose.
scripts/fixtures/**    linguist-vendored

# Written by scripts/site.py, scripts/language_pack.sh and the wasm build.
# Checking them in is deliberate -- the site is served from the repository --
# but they are output.
site/**                linguist-generated
dist/**                linguist-generated
ProjectGold/web/**     linguist-generated

# Grasm source, for the day the extension is recognised.
*.gr                   linguist-detectable
